// labtrack-bi: the DataFolder parameter.
// Power Query > Manage Parameters > New Parameter: Name DataFolder, Type Text, Required, and as the current value
// the full path of the data folder of this repository. Or: New Source > Blank Query > Advanced Editor > paste
// the line below, and name the query DataFolder.
"C:\labtrack-bi\data" meta [IsParameterQuery = true, Type = "Text", IsParameterQueryRequired = true]
